{"id":"adonde","lemma":"adonde","pos":"adv","rank":1910,"glosses":["to where, whither","whereto"],"ipa":"/aˈdonde/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-adonde.wav","examples":[{"text":"Corrí adonde mi madre.","en":"I ran to my mother.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450420"},{"text":"Pueden irse adonde quieran.","en":"You can go wherever you want.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721405"},{"text":"Podéis iros adonde queráis.","en":"You may go anywhere you like.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/525381"},{"text":"Yo voy adonde yo quiera.","en":"I go where I please.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449375"},{"text":"Iré adonde quieras que vaya.","en":"I'll go wherever you want me to go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/554783"}]}